      "content": "Please use channel app for user_id user_123 and help me with a few things: first, check whether product_id p_apple_airpods is in stock and buy the items [{product_id: p_apple_airpods, quantity: 1}] if available. Then see whether exchange NASDAQ is open and get the price for ticker AAPL converted to target_currency EUR. After that, check my available coupons, including coupon_code SAVE15, choose the best discount for 1 pair of AirPods, and place the order using payment_method credit_card. Then, using that stock quote, sell sell_quantity 5 shares of AAPL.\n\nNext, get the latest news_category business news and turn it into a priority high app digest titled news_title Business Headlines Digest. Also check flight_number AA100 on the gate board and send me a priority high app notice with its gate and status. Finally, create a priority high app document and alert summarizing the AirPods purchase, the AAPL stock sale, and the AA100 flight notice."
